 off the hook so easy. What it did, as with the whole climate change and sustainable development goal bonanza, has hurt us profoundly. \n\nIn 2021, Facebook trashed an entire group of over 100,000 people who were against forced vaccine mandates in Quebec; all of it, millions of posts, comments and info, in one single click, just disappeared. I couldn't believe it... it caused a deep collective wound; the damage, the treason, the scorn. The rape of our right to free expression. Facebook cannot be allowed to put our society at risk again. Bite me once, shame on you. Bite me twice, shame on me. \n\n@finkd, I unfortunately do not trust that you have what it takes personally to fight back in the event of a new rise in tyranny; the mettle of a man comes from the nature of his actions and not of his words, or promises. These here shared with us presently are words. \n\nThe risk is far too great. As well, I would declare that your civilizational motivations go against what the human race is in dire need of. Your goals to transform the physical life with a virtual/digital one is a damning scenario. Humanity must veer away from it.\n\nI do, however, wish you no harm. Thank you for opening up publicly; any effort done in mending the damage done will be a good gesture to help mend this complex wound.\n\n@joeroganhq", 'entity_set': {'hashtags': [], 'symbols': [], 'urls': [], 'user_mentions': [{'id_str': '20749410', 'name': 'Mark Zuckerberg', 'screen_name': 'finkd', 'indices': [621, 627]}, {'id_str': '2191193012', 'name': 'Joe Rogan Podcast News', 'screen_name': 'joeroganhq', 'indices': [1325, 1336]}]}}}}, 'legacy': {'bookmark_count': 1, 'bookmarked': False, 'created_at': 'Fri Jan 10 20:32:40 +0000 2025', 'conversation_id_str': '1877785993467642224', 'display_text_range': [14, 293], 'entities': {'hashtags': [], 'symbols': [], 'timestamps': [], 'urls': [], 'user_mentions': [{'id_str': '69156861', 'name': 'Chief Nerd', 'screen_name': 'TheChiefNerd', 'indices': [0, 13]}]}, 'favorite